  "worked_solution": "The surface area of our pyramid consists of $1$ square (base) and $4$ triangles (side faces). \n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Surface area} & =1\\times (\\text{Area of the base})+4\\times (\\text{Area of the side}) \\\\  & =1\\times 36+4\\times 30 \\\\  & =36+120 \\\\  & =156\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
